{"title":"Sheep","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sheep\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sheep?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>50,650</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sheep?lv=2\">Lv 2 <span>9,382</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sheep?lv=0\" title=\"Pick level 0\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td>50,650</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sheep\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>2</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>14</td><td>2.2</td><td>100</td><td class=\"muted\">42 · 3.1 · 300</td><td>9,382</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sheep\" data-map-level=\"2\">Show level 2 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-105.7px,-7.5px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:85.3px;top:18.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:15.8px;top:-28.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:90.7px;top:8.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:92.9px;top:14.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:147.1px;top:-7.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:126.6px;top:11.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:102.4px;top:6.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:108.3px;top:2.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:105.2px;top:8.3px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1711, 1809 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sheep\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-black\">Black Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-brown\">Brown Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-white\">White Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/b2c3404681ca365e5be9.webp\" alt=\"Sheep\"></div><h3>Sheep</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>2</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 2)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wildlife</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>14</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>2.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No (below level 10)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>23 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}